# Q: the convoy walks, and if nobody stops it, the agents win — the denial must be able to fail.
#
#   MiVic.Game.exe --mission pc_paperclip --probe tools/probe/pc-paperclip-loss.probe --probe-out artifacts/probe/pc-paperclip-loss.txt
#
# Nobody lifts a finger: the scientists are walked to the runway by their escort, four of
# them board, and the mission is lost. A denial that cannot fail is not one, so the loss is
# the first thing to watch.

objectives
teams
tick 120
expect "the convoy is on the road" 1.0 1.0 0.0
unit 49
unit 52
tick 3000
objectives
expect "the convoy is not through yet" 0.0 0.0 0.0
tick 8000
objectives
